# Host- and agent-local, never shipped and never tracked.
#
# This repo is PUBLIC. `.agent/` holds internal working notes and `logs/` holds
# runtime output from the production host — neither belongs in a public mirror,
# and neither should block a deploy. Untracked files in the app directory made
# the deploy script refuse (correctly: it cannot tell an internal note from an
# uncommitted hotfix), so they are declared here instead of being deleted off
# the box.
.agent/
logs/
